 2712: //    The eqs. for the 2 lines are: X=X1+(X2-X1)*tt1 and X=X3+(X4-X3)*tt2.	
 2713: //    Output: false: no intersection or colinear; true: exactly 1 intersection.	
 2714: //    If true, (xIntersect,yIntersect) is the intersection.				
 2715: //    Modified to only check tt2, assuming 0<=tt1<=1 is already assured. 
 2716: // **/
